  "description": "Polaris ingestion v1: accept/reject rate, reject reason breakdown, deprecated-schema usage, dedupe behaviour, origin and rate-limit drops, and pattern-based redaction counts. Panels reference `polaris_ingest_*` metrics defined in apps/ingester-api/src/metrics/registry.ts. Known gaps are listed in the 'About' panel.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Polaris Ingestion\n\nMetrics from `apps/ingester-api/src/metrics/registry.ts`, exposed at the ingester `/metrics` endpoint and scraped by Prometheus (job `polaris-ingester`).\n\n**Reject reasons** are the closed set from `packages/shared-schemas/src/reason-codes.ts`:\n\n- `unsupported_schema_version`, `schema_version_sunset`, `unknown_event`, `invalid_properties`, `invalid_envelope` — schema family\n- `forbidden_field_rejected` — forbidden-field policy reject tier\n- `duplicate` — short-window dedupe hit (event is _not_ counted as accepted)\n- `publish_failed` — accepted but Redpanda publish failed (used as the proxy for Redpanda publish-failure rate; see Redpanda dashboard)\n- `invalid_request` — malformed batch envelope\n\n**Known gaps** (P10-003):\n\n- No request-rate, accept-latency p50/p99/p999, or body-size histogram metric exists in v1; the request-rate panel uses `accepted_total + rejected_total` as a proxy and there is no latency panel. P10-002 owns the histogram swap.\n- No Redpanda publish-failure metric; this dashboard surfaces it as `rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{reason=\"publish_failed\"})`.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"]
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_accepted_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Accept vs reject rate (5m, ops)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.02 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) / (sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_accepted_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) + sum(rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "reject ratio",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Reject ratio (15m)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
